      ],
      "finding": "Non-gracious model roots descend through XY-expanded collision masks. The area threshold can terminate descent before a usable landing has been demonstrated."
    },
    {
      "path": "src/libslic3r/Support/TreeSupport3D.cpp",
      "lines": [
        5021,
